  "post_content": "<p><span style=\"display: inline !important; float: none; background-color: transparent; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;arial&quot;,&quot;times new roman&quot;,serif; font-size: 12.8px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 14.08px; orphans: 2; text-align: justify; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">La Conselleria d&rsquo;Educaci&oacute;, Investigaci&oacute;, Cultura i Esport, que dirige Vicent Marz&agrave; Ib&aacute;&ntilde;ez, ha financiado el proyecto de rehabilitaci&oacute;n de la torre redonda del Palacio de Ceyt Abu Ceyt de Argelita, seg&uacute;n la resoluci&oacute;n de 10 de agosto de 2018, de la Direcci&oacute;n General de Cultura y Patrimonio, por la que se conceden subvenciones destinadas a actuaciones de conservaci&oacute;n y protecci&oacute;n de los bienes inmuebles del patrimonio cultural de la Comunitat Valenciana.</span></p><div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/obrastorreceytabuceytargelita/img_0206.jpg\" alt=\"img_0206\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/obrastorreceytabuceytargelita/img_0209.jpg\" alt=\"img_0209\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/obrastorreceytabuceytargelita/img_0210.jpg\" alt=\"img_0210\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/obrastorreceytabuceytargelita/img_0211.jpg\" alt=\"img_0211\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/obrastorreceytabuceytargelita/img_0212.jpg\" alt=\"img_0212\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2